### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###

### 2. Criar projeto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projetos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Teste",
  "linguagem": "java",
  "framework": "spring-boot",
  "provedorCloud": "aws",
  "classes": [
    {
      "nome": "Usuario",
      "atributos": [
        {
          "nome": "nome",
          "tipo": "String"
        }
      ],
      "metodos": []
    }
  ],
  "servicosCloud": [
    {
      "id": "db-principal",
      "tipo": "aws-rds",
      "categoria": "DATA",
      "configuracao": {
        "engine": "postgres",
        "dbName": "projeto_teste",
        "username": "usuario_teste",
        "password": "senha_teste"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Buscar projeto (substitua {{id}})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}

###

### 4. Gerar artefatos
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}/gerar

###

### 5. Listar artefatos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}/artefatos

###

### 6. Diagrama UML
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}/diagrama/uml

###

### 7. Diagrama Cloud
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}/diagrama/cloud

###

### 8. Atualizar projeto
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Teste Atualizado",
  "linguagem": "java",
  "framework": "spring-boot",
  "provedorCloud": "aws",
  "classes": [
    {
      "nome": "Usuario",
      "atributos": [
        {
          "nome": "nome",
          "tipo": "String"
        }
      ],
      "metodos": []
    }
  ],
  "servicosCloud": [
    {
      "id": "db-principal",
      "tipo": "aws-rds",
      "categoria": "DATA",
      "configuracao": {
        "engine": "postgres",
        "dbName": "projeto_teste",
        "username": "usuario_teste",
        "password": "senha_teste"
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 9. Deletar projeto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/projetos/{{id}}

###

### Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html